 dovecot-vpopmail (>= 2.4.1)
Recommends: dsmr-localfirst (>= 1.0-4)
Description: DSMR qmail/vpopmail/dovecot mail stack -- metapackage
 One-shot installation target for the complete DSMR email infrastructure.
 Installing this package pulls the entire qmail/vpopmail/dovecot stack in
 correct dependency order.
 .
 This package carries only documentation:
  - DEVLOG.org: development log and Sagredo vs. DSMR configuration comparison
  - README.dsmr: per-package runtime documentation for each component
  - dsmr-verify: end-to-end stack validation script
 .
 System-first recipient routing (dsmr-localfirst) is recommended rather than
 required: it is needed only by hosts serving hybrid system/vpopmail domains and
 is inert until enabled with control/localfirst, so a standard vpopmail MTA can
 omit it.
 .
 After installation, run dsmr-verify to confirm the stack is operational.
